  "prefLabel": "He-M 306.06 Hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-M 306.06 Hearing. Upon receipt of the licensed practitioner’s written request for treatment authorization, the presiding officer shall:\n\n(a) Schedule a hearing to be held as soon as reasonably possible and, in any event, within 3 business days of the date of receipt of the written request for treatment authorization;\n\n(b) Notify the legal staff of New Hampshire hospital of the patient’s need for legal counsel; and\n\n(c) Conduct a hearing in accordance with He-C 203.\n\nSource. #3096, eff 8-19-85; EXPIRED: 8-19-91\n\nNew. #4708, eff 12-1-89, EXPIRED: 12-1-95\n\nNew. #7133, eff 11-23-99; ss by #7559, eff 9-25-01; ss by #9520, eff 8-4-09; ss by #10641, eff 7-18-14, EXPIRED: 7-18-24\n\nNew. #14637, eff 6-26-26, EXPIRES: 6-26-36 (formerly He-M 306.05)",
